{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A destination-less sort writes its answer back to the list it read. `sort %people% by age` with no\n`write to` builds to list.query plus a builder-appended variable.set(Name=%people%) — otherwise the\nquery answers a new list and the sort is lost. The assert on the order proves the write-back ran.",
  "step": [
